      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flight · Flow · Freedom </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape into a world kept secret by a tyrant, and discover the truth about your freedom. The King’s Bird is an artistic, momentum-based game that seamlessly combines precision-platforming with physics-based gliding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new yet easily accessible take on the precision-platforming genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic background music and sounds that change based on your movements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text-less narrative told through visuals in motion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five unique worlds to explore, full of vibrance and colorful silhouettes, with inspirations from ancient Mayan, Southeast Asian, and Roman cultures</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flight · Flow · Freedom </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape into a world kept secret by a tyrant, and discover the truth about your freedom. The King’s Bird is an artistic, momentum-based game that seamlessly combines precision-platforming with physics-based gliding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new yet easily accessible take on the precision-platforming genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic background music and sounds that change based on your movements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text-less narrative told through visuals in motion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five unique worlds to explore, full of vibrance and colorful silhouettes, with inspirations from ancient Mayan, Southeast Asian, and Roman cultures</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
      "short_description": "Escape into a world kept secret by a tyrant, and discover the truth about your freedom. Run, jump, and fly through forgotten lost kingdoms with a uniquely momentum-based flying mechanic.",
      "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America",
      "reviews": "“What makes it special though is the way it brings different stylistic choices together to truly capture the themes and feelings.”<br>82/100 – COG Connected<br><br>“The King’s Bird blends a beautiful design with superb and fluid mechanics to get a platformer that is just wonderful.”<br>85/100 – Areajugones<br><br>“The King’s Bird offers up a unique platforming experience through its gameplay and design, that leads to some pretty spectacular moments.”<br>8.2/10 – Digital Chumps<br>",
